{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46122","headline":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 五 · 贯休","name":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积劫修来似炼金，爲皇爲帝万灵钦。\n能当浊世爲清世，始见君心是佛心。\n九野黎民耕浩浩，百蛮朝骑日駸駸。\n今朝献寿将何比，愿似庄椿一万寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}